<!DOCTYPE html>
<html class="js" lang="en" data-tt-banners="edge">
<head>
{{> tt-head}}
<title>{{page.title}} - {{brand.name}}</title>
<meta name="description" content="{{metaDesc}}">
<link rel="canonical" href="{{canonical}}">
<script type="application/json" id="sf-config">{{{configJson}}}</script>
{{#if (eq page.title "Order Tracking")}}<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{assets_url}}/css/support.css">{{else if (eq page.title "Contact Us")}}<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{assets_url}}/css/support.css">{{/if}}
{{{trackingHead}}}
</head>
<body>
{{{trackingBody}}}
<div class="page-load-overlay" id="page-load-overlay" aria-hidden="true"><div class="page-load-overlay__spinner"></div></div>
<noscript><style>#page-load-overlay{display:none !important;}</style></noscript>
{{> header}}
<main class="body" id="main-content" role="main" data-currency-code="USD" data-template="pages-page">
{{#if (eq page.title "Order Tracking")}}<div class="tt-support min-h-screen"><main class="container mx-auto p-5 max-w-4xl"><div class="rounded-2xl shadow-sm mb-8 animate-fade-in p-5" style="background-color: rgb(252, 249, 244);"><div class="text-center mb-6"><h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold text-center mb-6" style="font-family: &quot;Crimson Text&quot;, serif, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: black;">Track Your Order</h2><p class="mb-3" style="font-size: 20px; font-family: &quot;Crimson Text&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Enter your order details to get real-time tracking information</p><section class="mb-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-4" data-testid="section-order-confirmation"><div><button class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-lg font-medium underline underline-offset-4 decoration-1 hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity cursor-pointer" data-testid="button-toggle-confirmation-section" style="font-family: &quot;Crimson Text&quot;, serif, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: black; font-weight: 600;">Didn't receive your order confirmation email?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></div><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out max-h-0 opacity-0" data-tt-collapse="1" data-tt-collapse="1"><div class="bg-white/60 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-[#e8e1d5] text-left" style="font-family: &quot;Crimson Text&quot;, serif, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><p class="text-black mb-4">No worries — we're here to help you find it. 💛 Before requesting a resend, here are a few things you can try:</p><ul class="space-y-2 mb-6 text-black"><li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-black mt-1">•</span><span>Check your Spam, Junk, or Promotions folders.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-black mt-1">•</span><span>Search your inbox for "{{@root.brand.name}}".</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-black mt-1">•</span><span>If you used Apple Pay, Google Pay, or PayPal, your confirmation may have been sent to the email linked to those accounts.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-black mt-1">•</span><span>If you entered the wrong email by mistake, we can still help locate your order.</span></li></ul><p class="text-black mb-6">If you still can't find your confirmation, you can request a resend below. Please provide the email address you intended to use at checkout so we can locate your order.</p><div class="flex justify-center"><button class="flex justify-center items-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-3 sm:gap-2 sm:px-6 rounded-full border border-black text-black bg-white hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors font-semibold whitespace-nowrap text-sm sm:text-base w-full sm:w-auto" data-testid="button-request-confirmation" data-tt-go="/pages/ask-order" style="font-family: &quot;Crimson Text&quot;, serif, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-send h-4 w-4 hidden min-[351px]:inline-block"><path d="M14.536 21.686a.5.5 0 0 0 .937-.024l6.5-19a.496.496 0 0 0-.635-.635l-19 6.5a.5.5 0 0 0-.024.937l7.93 3.18a2 2 0 0 1 1.112 1.11z"></path><path d="m21.854 2.147-10.94 10.939"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-mail h-4 w-4 hidden min-[351px]:inline-block"><rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2"></rect><path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"></path></svg>Request Order Confirmation</button></div></div></div></section></div><form class="space-y-6" id="tk-form" novalidate><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6"><div class="space-y-2"><label class="text-sm leading-none peer-disabled:cursor-not-allowed peer-disabled:opacity-70 font-medium" for="orderNumber" style="font-size: 20px; font-family: &quot;Crimson Text&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Order ID <span class="text-red-500">*</span></label><div class="relative"><input class="flex h-10 w-full rounded-md border bg-background px-3 text-base ring-offset-background file:border-0 file:bg-transparent file:text-sm file:font-medium file:text-foreground placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 md:text-sm pl-4 pr-10 py-3 border-slate-300 focus:border-blue-500 focus:ring-blue-500" id="orderNumber" placeholder="Enter your order ID" name="orderNumber" style="font-family: &quot;Crimson Text&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-hash absolute right-3 top-1/2 transform -translate-y-1/2 text-black h-4 w-4"><line x1="4" x2="20" y1="9" y2="9"></line><line x1="4" x2="20" y1="15" y2="15"></line><line x1="10" x2="8" y1="3" y2="21"></line><line x1="16" x2="14" y1="3" y2="21"></line></svg></div><p class="mt-1" style="font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;Crimson Text&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Your order ID is on your confirmation email.</p><p class="text-red-600" hidden data-tt-err style="font-size: 16px; font-family: &quot;Crimson Text&quot;, serif;">Order ID is required</p></div><div class="space-y-2"><label class="text-sm leading-none peer-disabled:cursor-not-allowed peer-disabled:opacity-70 font-medium" for="email" style="font-size: 20px; font-family: &quot;Crimson Text&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Email Address <span class="text-red-500">*</span></label><div class="relative"><input type="email" class="flex h-10 w-full rounded-md border bg-background px-3 text-base ring-offset-background file:border-0 file:bg-transparent file:text-sm file:font-medium file:text-foreground placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 md:text-sm pl-4 pr-10 py-3 border-slate-300 focus:border-blue-500 focus:ring-blue-500" id="email" placeholder="your@email.com" name="email" style="font-family: &quot;Crimson Text&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-mail absolute right-3 top-1/2 transform -translate-y-1/2 text-black h-4 w-4"><rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2"></rect><path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"></path></svg></div><p class="mt-1" style="font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;Crimson Text&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Use the same email you used at checkout.</p><p class="text-red-600" hidden data-tt-err style="font-size: 16px; font-family: &quot;Crimson Text&quot;, serif;">Valid email is required</p></div></div><button type="submit" class="shop-more-btn w-full" style="padding: 11px 20px; background: rgb(240, 179, 35); border-radius: 8px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Crimson Text&quot;, serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 20px; letter-spacing: 3.8px; line-height: 1; text-transform: uppercase; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; opacity: 1; cursor: pointer; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: none;"><span class="shimmer" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2" style="line-height: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-search h-4 w-4" style="flex-shrink: 0;"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"></path></svg><span style="padding-top: 2px;"> Track Order</span></span></button><div class="text-center mt-4"><a href="#order-faq" class="underline hover:opacity-70 cursor-pointer transition-opacity" data-testid="link-faq" style="font-size: 16px; font-family: &quot;Crimson Text&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Frequently Asked Questions</a></div></form></div><div class="mt-8"><div data-state="closed"><div class="support-portal bg-white rounded-lg border border-gray-200 shadow-sm overflow-hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="support-options-heading"><button type="button" aria-controls="tt-support-options" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-tt-portal-toggle class="w-full px-6 py-4 flex items-center gap-3 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors" data-testid="button-toggle-support-options"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-yellow-100 flex items-center justify-center" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-package w-5 h-5 text-yellow-600"><path d="M11 21.73a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73z"></path><path d="M12 22V12"></path><path d="m3.3 7 7.703 4.734a2 2 0 0 0 1.994 0L20.7 7"></path><path d="m7.5 4.27 9 5.15"></path></svg></div><div class="text-left flex-1"><h2 id="support-options-heading" class="font-semibold text-black text-lg">Support Options</h2><p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Need help with your order?</p></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 transition-transform duration-200 transform" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div data-state="closed" id="tt-support-options" hidden style="--radix-collapsible-content-height: 247px; --radix-collapsible-content-width: 854px;"><div class="px-6 pb-6 border-t border-gray-100"><p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-4 mt-4">Select an option below to manage your order or get assistance.</p><div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4"><button class="gap-2 rounded-lg font-bold ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 border border-input bg-background hover:text-accent-foreground w-full h-auto py-4 px-4 flex flex-col items-center justify-start hover:bg-gray-50" data-testid="button-modify-order" data-tt-go="/pages/change-variant"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-blue-100 flex items-center justify-center mb-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-refresh-ccw w-6 h-6 text-[#2563eb]"><path d="M21 12a9 9 0 0 0-9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8"></path><path d="M3 3v5h5"></path><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 0 0 9 9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0 6.74-2.74L21 16"></path><path d="M16 16h5v5"></path></svg></div><span class="ct-title text-black text-sm md:text-base text-center">Modify Order</span><span class="ct-body text-xs text-gray-500 text-center mt-1 hidden md:block">Swap, update, or remove items</span></button><button class="gap-2 rounded-lg font-bold ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 border border-input bg-background hover:text-accent-foreground w-full h-auto py-4 px-4 flex flex-col items-center justify-start hover:bg-gray-50" data-testid="button-cancel-order" data-tt-go="/pages/cancel-order"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-orange-100 flex items-center justify-center mb-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-x w-6 h-6 text-orange-600"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m15 9-6 6"></path><path d="m9 9 6 6"></path></svg></div><span class="ct-title text-black text-sm md:text-base text-center">Cancel Order</span><span class="ct-body text-xs text-gray-500 text-center mt-1 hidden md:block">Cancel your entire order</span></button><button class="gap-2 rounded-lg font-bold ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 border border-input bg-background hover:text-accent-foreground w-full h-auto py-4 px-4 flex flex-col items-center justify-start hover:bg-gray-50" data-testid="button-refund" data-tt-go="/pages/return-replace"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-green-100 flex items-center justify-center mb-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-dollar-sign w-6 h-6 text-green-600"><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="2" y2="22"></line><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"></path></svg></div><span class="ct-title text-black text-sm md:text-base text-center">Refund</span><span class="ct-body text-xs text-gray-500 text-center mt-1 hidden md:block">Request a refund</span></button><button class="gap-2 rounded-lg font-bold ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 border border-input bg-background hover:text-accent-foreground w-full h-auto py-4 px-4 flex flex-col items-center justify-start hover:bg-gray-50" data-testid="button-report-issue" data-tt-go="/pages/late-order"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-red-100 flex items-center justify-center mb-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-alert w-6 h-6 text-red-600"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="8" y2="12"></line><line x1="12" x2="12.01" y1="16" y2="16"></line></svg></div><span class="ct-title text-black text-sm md:text-base text-center">Report Issue</span><span class="ct-body text-xs text-gray-500 text-center mt-1 hidden md:block">Missing, damaged, or wrong items</span></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></main><section id="order-faq" class="py-8 md:py-16" style="background-color: rgb(252, 249, 244);"><div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-4xl"><div class="text-center mb-8 md:mb-12"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-black mb-4">Frequently Asked Questions</h2><p class="text-black" style="font-size: 20px;">Get quick answers to common questions about order tracking</p></div><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto"><div class="space-y-1"><div class="border-b border-gray-200 last:border-b-0"><button type="button" data-tt-faq-q class="w-full px-0 py-6 text-left flex items-center justify-between hover:opacity-75 transition-opacity"><h3 class="font-medium text-black pr-4" style="font-family: &quot;Crimson Text&quot;, serif; font-size: 20px;">How do I track my order?</h3><div class="text-2xl font-light flex-shrink-0" style="color: rgb(188, 141, 0);">+</div></button><div class="pb-6 pr-8" hidden data-tt-faq-a><p class="text-black leading-relaxed" style="font-family: &quot;Crimson Text&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;">Simply enter your order ID and the email address you used during checkout. You'll instantly see your order status and real-time tracking information.</p></div></div><div class="border-b border-gray-200 last:border-b-0"><button type="button" data-tt-faq-q class="w-full px-0 py-6 text-left flex items-center justify-between hover:opacity-75 transition-opacity"><h3 class="font-medium text-black pr-4" style="font-family: &quot;Crimson Text&quot;, serif; font-size: 20px;">Where can I find my order ID?</h3><div class="text-2xl font-light flex-shrink-0" style="color: rgb(188, 141, 0);">+</div></button><div class="pb-6 pr-8" hidden data-tt-faq-a><p class="text-black leading-relaxed" style="font-family: &quot;Crimson Text&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;">Your order ID can be found in your order confirmation email or on your receipt.</p></div></div><div class="border-b border-gray-200 last:border-b-0"><button type="button" data-tt-faq-q class="w-full px-0 py-6 text-left flex items-center justify-between hover:opacity-75 transition-opacity"><h3 class="font-medium text-black pr-4" style="font-family: &quot;Crimson Text&quot;, serif; font-size: 20px;">How often is tracking information updated?</h3><div class="text-2xl font-light flex-shrink-0" style="color: rgb(188, 141, 0);">+</div></button><div class="pb-6 pr-8" hidden data-tt-faq-a><p class="text-black leading-relaxed" style="font-family: &quot;Crimson Text&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;">Tracking information is updated in real-time from our shipping partners. Updates typically occur every few hours during transit.</p></div></div><div class="border-b border-gray-200 last:border-b-0"><button type="button" data-tt-faq-q class="w-full px-0 py-6 text-left flex items-center justify-between hover:opacity-75 transition-opacity"><h3 class="font-medium text-black pr-4" style="font-family: &quot;Crimson Text&quot;, serif; font-size: 20px;">What if my tracking number isn't working?</h3><div class="text-2xl font-light flex-shrink-0" style="color: rgb(188, 141, 0);">+</div></button><div class="pb-6 pr-8" hidden data-tt-faq-a><p class="text-black leading-relaxed" style="font-family: &quot;Crimson Text&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;">If your tracking number isn't showing results, it may take 24-48 hours after shipment for tracking information to appear. Contact us if issues persist.</p></div></div><div class="border-b border-gray-200 last:border-b-0"><button type="button" data-tt-faq-q class="w-full px-0 py-6 text-left flex items-center justify-between hover:opacity-75 transition-opacity"><h3 class="font-medium text-black pr-4" style="font-family: &quot;Crimson Text&quot;, serif; font-size: 20px;">How long does shipping take?</h3><div class="text-2xl font-light flex-shrink-0" style="color: rgb(188, 141, 0);">+</div></button><div class="pb-6 pr-8" hidden data-tt-faq-a><p class="text-black leading-relaxed" style="font-family: &quot;Crimson Text&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;">Shipping times vary by destination, but most orders arrive within 4 to 14 days. Typical delivery estimates are:

• United States: 4–14 days
• United Kingdom: 4–10 days
• Canada: 4–13 days
• Australia: 4–10 days
• Europe: 4–11 days
• Other countries: 4–12 days</p></div></div><div class="border-b border-gray-200 last:border-b-0"><button type="button" data-tt-faq-q class="w-full px-0 py-6 text-left flex items-center justify-between hover:opacity-75 transition-opacity"><h3 class="font-medium text-black pr-4" style="font-family: &quot;Crimson Text&quot;, serif; font-size: 20px;">Can I change my delivery address?</h3><div class="text-2xl font-light flex-shrink-0" style="color: rgb(188, 141, 0);">+</div></button><div class="pb-6 pr-8" hidden data-tt-faq-a><p class="text-black leading-relaxed" style="font-family: &quot;Crimson Text&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;">Once an order has shipped, delivery addresses cannot be changed through our system. Please contact customer support for assistance with address changes.</p></div></div><div class="border-b border-gray-200 last:border-b-0"><button type="button" data-tt-faq-q class="w-full px-0 py-6 text-left flex items-center justify-between hover:opacity-75 transition-opacity"><h3 class="font-medium text-black pr-4" style="font-family: &quot;Crimson Text&quot;, serif; font-size: 20px;">What causes shipping delays?</h3><div class="text-2xl font-light flex-shrink-0" style="color: rgb(188, 141, 0);">+</div></button><div class="pb-6 pr-8" hidden data-tt-faq-a><p class="text-black leading-relaxed" style="font-family: &quot;Crimson Text&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;">Shipping delays can occur due to weather conditions, customs processing, peak shipping seasons, incorrect addresses, or carrier service disruptions. We work closely with our shipping partners to minimize delays.</p></div></div><div class="border-b border-gray-200 last:border-b-0"><button type="button" data-tt-faq-q class="w-full px-0 py-6 text-left flex items-center justify-between hover:opacity-75 transition-opacity"><h3 class="font-medium text-black pr-4" style="font-family: &quot;Crimson Text&quot;, serif; font-size: 20px;">How long does it take to process a return or exchange?</h3><div class="text-2xl font-light flex-shrink-0" style="color: rgb(188, 141, 0);">+</div></button><div class="pb-6 pr-8" hidden data-tt-faq-a><p class="text-black leading-relaxed" style="font-family: &quot;Crimson Text&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;">Returns and exchanges typically take 5-7 business days to process once we receive your returned item. Refunds are issued to your original payment method within 1–10 business days after processing, depending on your bank's timeline.</p></div></div><div class="border-b border-gray-200 last:border-b-0"><button type="button" data-tt-faq-q class="w-full px-0 py-6 text-left flex items-center justify-between hover:opacity-75 transition-opacity"><h3 class="font-medium text-black pr-4" style="font-family: &quot;Crimson Text&quot;, serif; font-size: 20px;">Which countries do you ship to and how much does it cost?</h3><div class="text-2xl font-light flex-shrink-0" style="color: rgb(188, 141, 0);">+</div></button><div class="pb-6 pr-8" hidden data-tt-faq-a><p class="text-black leading-relaxed" style="font-family: &quot;Crimson Text&quot;, serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;">We deliver our magical products to over 150 countries worldwide—and for a limited time, we're offering free shipping on all orders, with no minimum required!</p></div></div></div></div><div class="text-center mt-12"><p class="text-black mb-4" style="font-family: &quot;Crimson Text&quot;, serif; font-size: 20px;">Still have questions?</p><div class="flex justify-center"><a href="{{@root.policyLinks.contact}}" class="cta-btn inline-flex items-center justify-center" style="position: relative;"><span style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; line-height: 1; visibility: visible;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-mail" style="width: 1.2rem; height: 1.2rem; flex-shrink: 0;"><rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2"></rect><path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"></path></svg><span style="padding-top: 2.5px;">Contact Support</span></span></a></div></div></div></section></div>{{else if (eq page.title "Contact Us")}}<div class="tt-support min-h-screen"><main class="container mx-auto px-4 py-8 max-w-6xl"><section class="mb-8"><div class="space-y-6"><h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold text-center mb-6" style="font-family: &quot;Crimson Text&quot;, serif, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: black;">Do you have an issue with an Existing Order?</h2><div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4"><button class="gap-2 rounded-lg font-bold ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 border border-input bg-background hover:text-accent-foreground w-full h-auto py-4 px-4 flex flex-col items-center justify-start hover:bg-gray-50 text-left" data-testid="button-modify-order" data-tt-go="/pages/change-variant"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-blue-100 flex items-center justify-center mb-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-refresh-ccw w-6 h-6 text-blue-600"><path d="M21 12a9 9 0 0 0-9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8"></path><path d="M3 3v5h5"></path><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 0 0 9 9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0 6.74-2.74L21 16"></path><path d="M16 16h5v5"></path></svg></div><span class="ct-title text-black text-sm md:text-base text-center">Modify Order</span><span class="ct-body text-xs text-gray-500 text-center mt-1 hidden md:block">Swap, update, or remove items</span></button><button class="gap-2 rounded-lg font-bold ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 border border-input bg-background hover:text-accent-foreground w-full h-auto py-4 px-4 flex flex-col items-center justify-start hover:bg-gray-50" data-testid="button-cancel-order" data-tt-go="/pages/cancel-order"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-orange-100 flex items-center justify-center mb-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-x w-6 h-6 text-orange-600"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m15 9-6 6"></path><path d="m9 9 6 6"></path></svg></div><span class="ct-title text-black text-sm md:text-base text-center">Cancel Order</span><span class="ct-body text-xs text-gray-500 text-center mt-1 hidden md:block">Cancel your entire order</span></button><button class="gap-2 rounded-lg font-bold ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 border border-input bg-background hover:text-accent-foreground w-full h-auto py-4 px-4 flex flex-col items-center justify-start hover:bg-gray-50" data-testid="button-refund" data-tt-go="/pages/return-replace"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-green-100 flex items-center justify-center mb-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-dollar-sign w-6 h-6 text-green-600"><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="2" y2="22"></line><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"></path></svg></div><span class="ct-title text-black text-sm md:text-base text-center">Refund</span><span class="ct-body text-xs text-gray-500 text-center mt-1 hidden md:block">Request a refund</span></button><button class="gap-2 rounded-lg font-bold ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 border border-input bg-background hover:text-accent-foreground w-full h-auto py-4 px-4 flex flex-col items-center justify-start hover:bg-gray-50" data-testid="button-report-issue" data-tt-go="/pages/late-order"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-red-100 flex items-center justify-center mb-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-alert w-6 h-6 text-red-600"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="8" y2="12"></line><line x1="12" x2="12.01" y1="16" y2="16"></line></svg></div><span class="ct-title text-black text-sm md:text-base text-center">Report Issue</span><span class="ct-body text-xs text-gray-500 text-center mt-1 hidden md:block">Missing, damaged, or wrong items</span></button></div></div></section><section class="mb-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto" data-testid="section-order-confirmation"><div class="text-center"><button class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-lg font-medium underline underline-offset-4 decoration-1 hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity cursor-pointer" data-testid="button-toggle-confirmation" style="font-family: &quot;Crimson Text&quot;, serif, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: black;">Didn't receive your order confirmation email?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 transition-transform duration-200 "><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></div><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out max-h-0 opacity-0" data-tt-collapse="1"><div class="bg-white/60 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-[#e8e1d5]" style="font-family: &quot;Crimson Text&quot;, serif, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><p class="text-black mb-4">No worries — we're here to help you find it. 💛 Before requesting a resend, here are a few things you can try:</p><ul class="space-y-2 mb-6 text-black"><li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-black mt-1">•</span><span>Check your Spam, Junk, or Promotions folders.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-black mt-1">•</span><span>Search your inbox for "{{@root.brand.name}}".</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-black mt-1">•</span><span>If you used Apple Pay, Google Pay, or PayPal, your confirmation may have been sent to the email linked to those accounts.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-black mt-1">•</span><span>If you entered the wrong email by mistake, we can still help locate your order.</span></li></ul><p class="text-black mb-6">If you still can't find your confirmation, you can request a resend below. Please provide the email address you intended to use at checkout so we can locate your order.</p><div class="flex justify-center"><button class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-3 sm:gap-2 sm:px-6 rounded-full border border-black text-black bg-white hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors font-medium whitespace-nowrap text-sm sm:text-base" data-testid="button-request-confirmation" data-tt-go="/pages/ask-order" style="font-family: &quot;Crimson Text&quot;, serif, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-send h-4 w-4"><path d="M14.536 21.686a.5.5 0 0 0 .937-.024l6.5-19a.496.496 0 0 0-.635-.635l-19 6.5a.5.5 0 0 0-.024.937l7.93 3.18a2 2 0 0 1 1.112 1.11z"></path><path d="m21.854 2.147-10.94 10.939"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-mail h-4 w-4"><rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2"></rect><path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"></path></svg>Request Order Confirmation</button></div></div></div></section><section class="mt-8" data-testid="section-contact-form"><div class="w-full"><h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold text-center mb-6" style="font-family: &quot;Crimson Text&quot;, serif, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: black;">Still Need Help?</h3><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 p-5 md:p-6 shadow-lg"><form class="space-y-4" id="tt-contact-form" novalidate><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-5"><div class="space-y-2"><label class="font-medium peer-disabled:cursor-not-allowed peer-disabled:opacity-70 font-ct-body text-sm md:text-base text-black" for="contact-name">Name <span class="text-red-500">*</span></label><input type="text" class="flex w-full rounded-md border border-input bg-background px-3 py-2 ring-offset-background file:border-0 file:bg-transparent file:text-sm file:font-medium file:text-foreground placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 md:text-sm h-11 md:h-12 text-base" id="contact-name" placeholder="Your name" data-testid="input-contact-name" value=""></div><div class="space-y-2"><label class="font-medium peer-disabled:cursor-not-allowed peer-disabled:opacity-70 font-ct-body text-sm md:text-base text-black" for="contact-email">Email <span class="text-red-500">*</span></label><input type="email" class="flex w-full rounded-md border border-input bg-background px-3 py-2 ring-offset-background file:border-0 file:bg-transparent file:text-sm file:font-medium file:text-foreground placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 md:text-sm h-11 md:h-12 text-base" id="contact-email" placeholder="your@email.com" data-testid="input-contact-email" value=""></div></div><div class="space-y-2"><label class="font-medium peer-disabled:cursor-not-allowed peer-disabled:opacity-70 font-ct-body text-sm md:text-base text-black" for="contact-order">Order Number <span class="text-gray-400 text-sm">(optional)</span></label><input type="text" class="flex w-full rounded-md border border-input bg-background px-3 py-2 ring-offset-background file:border-0 file:bg-transparent file:text-sm file:font-medium file:text-foreground placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 md:text-sm h-11 md:h-12 text-base" id="contact-order" placeholder="e.g. JUMDY" data-testid="input-contact-order" value=""></div><div class="space-y-2"><label class="font-medium peer-disabled:cursor-not-allowed peer-disabled:opacity-70 font-ct-body text-sm md:text-base text-black" for="contact-message">Message <span class="text-red-500">*</span></label><textarea class="flex w-full rounded-md border border-input bg-background px-3 py-2 ring-offset-background placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 md:text-sm min-h-[100px] md:min-h-[120px] resize-none text-base" id="contact-message" placeholder="How can we help?" data-testid="input-contact-message"></textarea></div><div hidden data-tt-contact-err class="flex items-start gap-3 rounded-lg border border-red-200 bg-red-50 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-red-800" data-testid="text-contact-error"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-alert mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-red-500"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="8" y2="12"></line><line x1="12" x2="12.01" y1="16" y2="16"></line></svg><span>Please enter your name</span></div><div class="pt-2"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 px-4 py-2 w-full h-auto bg-[#ffc520] hover:bg-[#e6b01d] text-black font-bold rounded-lg disabled:opacity-50" type="submit" data-testid="button-contact-submit" style="padding: 13px 20px; font-family: &quot;Crimson Text&quot;, serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 3.8px; text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 1;"><span style="padding-top: 3px;">Submit</span></button></div></form></div></div></section></main><p class="tt-contact-ok" data-tt-contact-ok hidden>Thank you! Your message has been sent. We will get back to you within 24 hours.</p></div>{{else}}<section id="policy-page"><div class="container"><h1 class="page-heading">{{page.title}}</h1>{{{page.bodyHtml}}}</div></section>{{/if}}
